msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Now, there is the matter of the 300,000 yen production fee, to be paid in "
"advance. Are you prepared to provide that at this point, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Welcome! And my most sincere congratulations on being selected as a product "
"tester! How exciting for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Our company's Super IH Water Purifier is state-of-the-art, utilizing the "
"same electromagnetic coil system as induction heaters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Electromagnetic power not only removes chlorine but also kills bacteria and "
"adds alkali ions, so your water will actually make you healthy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Oh, pardon me... I haven't asked you your name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san? All right, then, Kiryu-san... From what you've heard so far, do "
"you have an idea of how wonderful our Super IH Water Purifier is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "More or less..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Well, wait till you hear this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"All people selected to test our water purifiers will get to keep the model "
"they tested after the evaluation period is through!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"We're talking about a Super IH Water Purifier that sells for 1,000,000 yen "
"at retail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Now what do you think? Isn't it the most amazing product you've ever seen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Stop asking me that and get on with your pitch already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"The Super IH Water Purifier produces water that makes you healthy just by "
"drinking it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"And right now, you've earned the right to receive one free of charge, "
"Kiryu-san! There's just one thing I'd like you to know first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"There happens to be a 300,000 yen fee to have the product professionally "
"installed in your home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"That's actually the price of the necessary parts. You don't have to pay for "
"labor. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"That's right. The Super IH Water Purifier itself and the plumbing labor "
"costs are on us. You just pay for parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"So, Kiryu-san, I know 300,000 yen is a fair amount, but what do you say? "
"It's a small price to pay for such a life-altering device!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "And could we ask you to pay that installation fee up front?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Sorry. I don't have that much on me at the moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Oh, is that so? Well, we'll wait here, so come right back once you're ready "
"to pay the fee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Yes, we'll be right here! Come back as soon as you can! Thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Yeah. Will this do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Thank you! Thank you very much! We'll have the Super IH Water Purifier "
"delivered to your home. We'll be in touch to schedule the installation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>IH Water Purifier<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Let me show you the way out. Have a great day! And thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Quit yanking my chain. Why should I have to give you 300,000 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "I'm telling you, it's for parts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "And I'm telling you I don't want to pay it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Think about this carefully, Kiryu-san. You're getting a 1,000,000 yen "
"miracle for the low, low price of 300,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Who cares? I don't need it. This is ridiculous. I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "What's that? You think you can just walk on out of here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Sorry. Even if I wanted to pay, I just don't have that much on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Listen, buddy! Who do you think you are, taking advantage of our CEO's "
"kindness like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"Maybe he'll listen to reason if we knock him around a little bit. But don't "
"be too rough. We wouldn't want him to croak on us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Fine. Is this enough?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "000 yen <Color:8>300<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"Thank you! Thank you very much! We'll have the Super IH Water Purifier "
"delivered to your home. We'll be in touch to schedule the installation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>IH Water Purifier<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Let me show you the way out. Have a great day! Thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "You bet I do. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Get back here! Hey!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Not so fast, pal. You can't leave our office until you agree to "
"test our water purifier, see?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"If you don't get how awesome this purifier is, we're just gonna have to "
"pound it into you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "You just don't quit, do you? I told you, I don't want any part of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"I guess it's come to this, then. Don't be too rough. We wouldn't want him "
"to croak on us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Pay 300,000 Yen"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
